                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "236435775",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198065476014",
                            "num_reviews": 53,
                            "playtime_forever": 19,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 19,
                            "last_played": 1790641129
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The puzzle pieces don't feel satisfying. Within each puzzle, most of the pieces have the same shape, which is really disappointing because the colors and atmosphere of this game are beautiful.\n\nBut I can't recommend the game with the puzzle pieces designed like this. It feels very AI generated to me. I also couldn't find any information about the use of Ai on the Steam store page, which is even worse. I'd rather see the developers openly mention it and stand by their use of AI instead of hiding it from their players.",
